{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":123,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಬಾಧಿಸಲ್ಪಟ್ಟವನ ನಿರೀಕ್ಷೆ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಯಾತ್ರಾಗೀತೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಪರಲೋಕದಲ್ಲಿ ಆಸೀನನಾಗಿರುವಾತನೇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನನ್ನ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳನ್ನು ನಿನ್ನ ಕಡೆಗೆ ಎತ್ತಿದ್ದೇನೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯಜಮಾನನ ಕೈಯನ್ನು ದಾಸನ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯಜಮಾನಿಯ ಕೈಯನ್ನು ದಾಸಿಯ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು ನೋಡುವ ಪ್ರಕಾರವೇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಮ್ಮ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು ನಮ್ಮ ಯೆಹೋವ ದೇವರನ್ನು ನೋಡುತ್ತಾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಕಟಾಕ್ಷವನ್ನು ನಿರೀಕ್ಷಿಸಿಕೊಂಡಿವೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನೇ, ನಮ್ಮನ್ನು ಕಟಾಕ್ಷಿಸು, ಕಟಾಕ್ಷಿಸು.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಅವಮಾನ ಹೊಂದಿ ಹೊಂದಿ ನಮಗೆ ಸಾಕಾಯಿತು;","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಲೋಕಭೋಗಿಗಳ ಹಾಸ್ಯದಿಂದಲೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಗರ್ವಿಷ್ಠರ ನಿಂದೆಯಿಂದಲೂ ನಮ್ಮ ಮನಸ್ಸು ಬೇಸತ್ತು ಹೋಯಿತು.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/123.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/124.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/122.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":4}